    {
      "text": "Pharaoh said … I have set thee over all the land of Egypt, Gen. 41:41. set in order the things that are to be set in order, Ex. 40:4. Let the Lord … set a man over the congregation, Num. 27:16. set him before Eleazar, Num. 27:19. I have set before thee this day life, Deut. 30:15. I have this day set thee over the nations, Jer. 1:10. I set before you the way of life, Jer. 21:8. set up a kingdom, which shall never be destroyed, Dan. 2:44 (D&C 65:5; 109:72). judgment was set, Dan. 7:10. didst set thine heart to understand, Dan. 10:12.",
